Task 1: Online Book Rental Management System
Objective
Develop a Spring Boot application using JpaRepository to manage books available for rent in an
online library.
Entity Class: RentalBook
Variables- Long bookId- String bookTitle- String authorName- String category- Double rentalPrice
Methods- Getters and Setters- Constructors- toString()
Repository Interface: RentalBookRepository
public interface RentalBookRepository extends JpaRepository<RentalBook, Long> {}
Service Class: RentalBookService
Methods- saveBook(RentalBook book)- saveAllBooks(List<RentalBook> books)- getBookById(Long id)- getAllBooks()- updateBook(RentalBook book)- deleteBookById(Long id)- deleteAllBooks()- countBooks()- existsBook(Long id)
Requirements
1. Add a new rental book using save().
2. Add multiple rental books using saveAll().
3. Display all books using findAll().
4. Search a book by ID using findById().
5. Check whether a book exists using existsById().
6. Count total books using count().
7. Update rental price of a book using save().
8. Delete a book using deleteById().
9. Delete all books using deleteAll().
Main Class
Perform all operations through CommandLineRunner and print results on console